1
00:00:00,712 --> 00:00:04,312
(Bernadette:)He's so little. I'm sure it's fine.
How can it be fine?

2
00:00:04,316 --> 00:00:07,916
(Howard:)I just got attacked by a clearly
anti-Semitic wild animal.

3
00:00:10,189 --> 00:00:14,259
(Leonard:)It's not what we planned,
but this isn't so bad, right?

4
00:00:14,259 --> 00:00:17,729
(Penny:)It is freaking amazing.

5
00:00:17,729 --> 00:00:20,259
(Leonard:)Well, glad
you're feeling better.

6
00:00:20,265 --> 00:00:22,295
(Penny:)I was just hungry and cranky,

7
00:00:22,301 --> 00:00:24,801
(Penny:)and I've never been called
"ma'am" before.

8
00:00:24,803 --> 00:00:26,303
(Leonard:)Is that a big deal?

9
00:00:26,305 --> 00:00:29,275
(Penny:)Kind of. When was the first time
someone called you "sir"?

10
00:00:29,274 --> 00:00:30,704
(Leonard:)Sixth grade,

11
00:00:30,709 --> 00:00:33,639
(Leonard:)but I wore a sport coat
and carried a briefcase, so...

12
00:00:34,479 --> 00:00:37,579
(Penny:)Can you believe
when I met you I was 22?

13
00:00:37,583 --> 00:00:39,483
(laughs)
I mean, it's crazy!

14
00:00:39,484 --> 00:00:41,184
(Penny:)Where did all that time go?

15
00:00:41,186 --> 00:00:45,186
(Leonard:)Mm, you watched
The Bachelor a lot.

16
00:00:45,190 --> 00:00:47,020
(Penny:)Yeah, go ahead and make jokes,

17
00:00:47,025 --> 00:00:48,755
(Penny:)but your thirties
are almost over.

18
00:00:48,760 --> 00:00:50,190
(Leonard:)No, they're not.

19
00:00:50,195 --> 00:00:52,095
(Penny:)You're closer to 40
than you are 30.

20
00:00:52,097 --> 00:00:55,667
Ha, ha! You
married an old man.

21
00:00:55,667 --> 00:00:57,637
(Leonard:)Tell you what.

22
00:00:57,636 --> 00:00:59,136
(Leonard:)Let's do something
fun tonight.

23
00:00:59,137 --> 00:01:00,437
(Penny:)Won't make us any younger.

